&ldquo;I was visiting Mongolian friends at Tsgaan Sar, the celebration of the lunar new year. Everyone gets dressed up in their best&mdash;and these two boys were no exception. The expressions on their faces are so clear&mdash;confidence on the face of the boy on the left and uncertainty and timidness on the face of the little boy on the right.&rdquo;

- Peace Corps Business Development Volunteer Judy Gates
